[{"id":4430998327,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCBurNw","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?u=b7882c94f408976a2f79e8fe6e1ce27fbd48db74&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"So earlier in the function we use `get_shallow_script` when there is no script, but here we recognize that the shallow scripts don't work for the purposes of this function.\n\nI'd argue we should not call `get_shallow_script` in the function then. A better approach IMHO would be to go by `kind`.\n- `kind == CLASS` -> `class_type` is always valid\n- `kind == SCRIPT` -> `script_type` is always valid\n(We really need to clean this datatype representation up. A tagged union would make sense. I'd argue accessing `script_type` on a `CLASS` is just asking for bugs since initialization is very inconsistent.)\n\nAlso this proposed fix will still not be able to correctly handle a case were one type is `CLASS` and the other one is `SCRIPT`.\n","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119592#pullrequestreview-4430998327","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119592","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119592#pullrequestreview-4430998327"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119592"}},"submitted_at":"2026-06-04T19:55:04Z","commit_id":"f0410fc075e79072fc4d6aa9cdd53cbc860da130"},{"id":4826651032,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABH7DZmA","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?u=b7882c94f408976a2f79e8fe6e1ce27fbd48db74&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119592#pullrequestreview-4826651032","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119592","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119592#pullrequestreview-4826651032"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119592"}},"submitted_at":"2026-07-31T08:10:55Z","commit_id":"f17c53dc0dc5c1f38fa762bac0c9f8c2c7aec78e"},{"id":4826662013,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABH7EEfQ","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?u=b7882c94f408976a2f79e8fe6e1ce27fbd48db74&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Overall the change makes sense to me. I can't spot any immediate differences between those two functions in the context this PR touches. If any issues arise from this, they would be bugs with `is_type_compatible`.\n\nStill I'd consider the change a bit of a wildcard, so we shouldn't merge it too close to a final release, so that potential bugs can be ironed out.\n\nAlso please remove the reference to the issue from the comment message. It can cause notification spam on Github.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119592#pullrequestreview-4826662013","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119592","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119592#pullrequestreview-4826662013"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/